:INFO
Art. 35 Transitional provisions
Until the laws relating to the promotion of universities and coordination of Swiss tertiary education come into force, the following provisions apply in relation to the Federal Institute of Sport:
a. The Federal Institute of Sport shall cooperate with existing vocational schools. The DDPS is responsible for the conclusion of related agreements.
b. The DDPS is responsible for the accreditation of study courses; it may issue guidelines.
|

:INFO
Art. 36 Coordination of Article 367 para. 2quinquies of the Swiss Criminal Code with the modifications of 19 March 2010 in the Armed Forces Act
Regardless of whether the amendment of 19 March 2010 to the Armed Forces Act of 3 February 1995 or the present amendment applies first, on commencement of the act which comes into force later, or even if both come into force at the same time, Article 367 para 2quinquies of the Swiss Criminal Code becomes 367 Article 2sexies of the Swiss Criminal Code
|

:NOTE
AS 2010 6015 and 2011 487
SR 510.10
SR 311.0
|

:INFO
Art. 37 Referendum und commencement
1 This Act is subject to an optional referendum.
2 The Confederation determines the commencement date.
Commencement date: 1 October 2012
|

:NOTE
Para. 2 — FCD of 23 May 2012.

